  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale-Up of Clean Team Phase 1 - Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Scale-Up of Clean Team Phase 1 - Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP) is a component of Water and Sanitation for the Urban Poor (WSUP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;800,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Waste management/disposal, Sanitation - large systems, Basic sanitation, Research/scientific institutions, Health education.</narrative>
  </description>
